"file still marks the FiveAges Gen\\* trees `private`, so `./init.sh` does"
" not select them by default. See "
"[robot_usds](../simulation/3-robot_usds.md)."
msgstr ""
"检出：按"
"[robot_usds README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)"
"§2.1 单独执行 `git submodule update --init humanoid/FiveAges/Gen2`（以及 `…/Gen1`"
"），或用 FaSim-Isaac 的 **`./init.sh`**（按 `submodules_visibility.conf`初始化"
"`robots/`的那一步），然后 **`./run.sh`**。FaSim 的可见性文件仍把 FiveAges Gen\\* 树标成 `private`"
"，因此 `./init.sh`默认不会勾选它们。见 [robot_usds](../simulation/3-robot_usds.md)。"

